\par\par \b \uc2  HK Dollar Late Close To Key Level; Forward Premiums Climb \b0\par\par\uc2 312 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 1 April 1998\par 10:01\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  HONG KONG (Dow Jones)--The Hong Kong dollar stayed close to the key support level late Wednesday amid cautious trading, but forward premiums climbed substantially higher. \par \par \uc2  While the spot rate of the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  edges perilously close to a key support level late Wednesday at HK$7.7495 to one U.S. dollar, the forward market has been very active. \par \par \uc2  'Affected by the unstable regional situation, banks have turned very cautious,' said a dealer at an American bank. \par \par \uc2  He said some players decided to cover their short positions in the forward market, pushing the forward premiums up. \par \par \uc2  'But there is no sign of any speculative activities,' he said. \par \par \uc2  The Hong Kong dollar has traded in a range of HK$7.7480 and HK$7.7498 so far Wednesday, wider than its extremely narrow range range recently. \par \par \uc2  Regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  have generally weakened early Wednesday, undermined by the continued weakness of Japanese yen. \par \par \uc2  The market expects the \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2 , \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong\b0 \highlight\uc2 's quasi-\b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  if the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  comes too close to HK$7.750. \par \par \uc2  In the forward \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, the one-month is quoted at 40 points from five late in the previous session. The three-month premium is quoted at 250 points, compared with 160 points previously. The six-month premium is quoted at 780 points, up from 700 previously. The one-year premium is quoted at 2,300 points, up from 2,000 previously. \par \par \uc2  The overnight Hong Kong Interbank Offered Rate is quoted at 4.24%, compared with 4.625% late during the previous session. The three-month rate is 6.75% from 6.625% late Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  For more Hibor news, please refer to Dow Jones page \par \par \uc2  -By Noel Fung; (852) 2802 7002; nfung@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 01-04-98 \par \par \uc2  0801GMT \par \par \uc2  1053 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du4102rqo\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
