\par\par \b \uc2  HK Dlr Weaker On Lower Rates; Forward Premiums Hit New Low \b0\par\par\uc2 333 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1998\par 11:00\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  HONG KONG (Dow Jones)--The Hong Kong dollar was slightly weaker Friday on lower interbank rates, which also brought the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's forward contract premiums to new low levels. \par \par \uc2  Around 0930 GMT (4:30 a.m. EST), the Hong Kong dollar was quoted at HK$7.7490 against the U.S. dollar, slightly weaker than HK$7.7488 late Thursday. \par \par \uc2  The Hong Kong dollar has traded in a narrow range of HK$7.7485 and HK$7.7490 so far Friday. \par \par \uc2  In line with the slowly declining interbank rates, the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has gradually weakened against the greenback during the week. \par \par \uc2  It is expected that the \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to stop the rate from breaching the key support level of HK$7.7500. \par \par \uc2  An abundant supply of short-term funds and an extremely steep yield curve have combined to bring down forward premiums as well. \par \par \uc2  'Banks who took longer-term positions to hedge against market volatility are suffering from negative carry,' a dealer at an American bank said. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the interest rate differential between one-year and three-month money was about 250 basis points, a gap not seen since 1995. \par \par \uc2  For the first time in months, the one-month forward rate was traded at a discount of five points, compared with a premium of five points late Thursday. \par \par \uc2  The three-month premium is at 140 points, down from 180 points previously. The six-month premium is at 700 points, down from 790 points, and the one-year premium is at 1900 points, down from 2400 points. \par \par \uc2  The overnight Hong Kong Interbank Offered Rates is quoted at 4.0625%, down slightly from 4.125% late Thursday. The three-month rate is 6.25%, down from 6.50% late Thursday. \par \par \uc2  For more Hibor news, please refer to Dow Jones page \par \par \uc2  -By Noel Fung; (852) 2802 7002; nfung@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 20-03-98 \par \par \uc2  1000GMT \par \par \uc2  1053 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du3k02et8\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
