\par\par \b \uc2  HK Dollar Stable Despite Rupiah's Tumble; Forwards Ease \b0\par\par\uc2 340 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1998\par 06:29\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  HONG KONG (Dow Jones)--The Hong Kong dollar remained stable Monday morning despite concern over the Indonesia rupiah's fall after the International Monetary Fund's decision to delay disbursing assistance funds. \par \par \uc2  Around 0415 GMT (11:15 p.m. EST Sunday), the Hong Kong dollar is quoted by the Bank of China at HK$7.7440 per U.S. dollar, weakened mildly from 7.7437 last Friday. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. unit has traded in a range of HK$7.7428 and HK$7.7450 so far Monday. \par \par \uc2  The local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  started at HK$7.7428 early before weakening to HK$7.7440 per U.S. dollar. \par \par \uc2  'There was initial concern over the rupiah's fall against the U.S. dollar but it was subsequently digested,' a dealer at a Chinese bank said. \par \par \uc2  At 0237 GMT (9:37 p.m. EST), the rupiah was trading at 11,550 rupiah (IDR) to the U.S dollar, lower than its close last week at IDR10,900. \par \par \uc2  The present level of the Hong Kong dollar is expected to be sustainable as the overnight rate of 4.5% commands a premium of 1.0 percentage point over the U.S. dollar. \par \par \uc2  The interest rate differential has encouraged arbitrage activities, as the two \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  are pegged. \par \par \uc2  The arbitrage is likely to stop as the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  edges close to HK$7.7500 per U.S. dollar, a level that is believed would trigger the \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  In the forward \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, the one-month premium is quoted at 85 points, down from 110 points previously. The three-month premium is quoted at 460 points, compared with 530 points late during the previous session. \par \par \uc2  'There were a couple of big-name banks lending in the market, pulling down the forward premiums,' the dealer said. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par For more Hibor news, please refer to Dow Jones Newswires\par    -By Noel Fung; (852)2802-7002; nfung@ap.org\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) Dow Jones Newswires 09-03-98\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 0529GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1053 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du39020ww\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
