massive sell-off Wednesday. The red-chip Index tumbled 11% while the property sub-index dipped 8.4%. The blue-chip Hang Seng Index, meanwhile, ended down 596.90 points, or 5.9%, at 9538.61. \par \par \uc2  Wednesday's move puts the benchmark index down 1,184.15 points, or 11%, in the first week of 1998, compared to its close on New Year's Eve last Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  Meanwhile, overnight on Wall Street, the Dow Jones Industrial Average shed 3.98 points, ending at 7902.27 Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  -By Patty Zhao; 852 2802 7002; pzhao@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 08-01-98 \par \par \uc2  0141GMT \par \par \uc2  5013 55108 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du1800503\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
