\par\par \b \uc2  HK Dollar Flat Late; U.S. Dlr Sell Orders At HK$7.7500 \b0\par\par\uc2 318 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 Januar 1998\par 09:37\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  HONG KONG (Dow Jones)--Despite steep falls in most Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the Hong Kong dollar stayed extremely flat late Thursday as few traders dare weaken the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  since it would most likely prompt strong government \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Dealers said that while \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong\b0 \highlight\uc2  stock and bond markets are dropping in reaction to the deepening Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  crisis, traders are reluctant to take the Hong Kong dollar substantially past the HK$7.7500 per U.S. dollar level. \par \par \uc2  That's because the \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which is said to have been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  aggressively in the past weeks, has sell orders right above that level, a reminder that any punt against the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  will be met with stiff resistance. \par \par \uc2  Around GMT, the U.S. dollar is quoted at HK$7.7498, virtually flat from HK$7.7500 late Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  'It's no surprise the TT (U.S. dollar against the Hong Kong dollar) is so stable,' one money markets manager said. 'There's some selling interest at HK$7.7500. It's believed the government is up there to cap the (U.S. dollar's) rise. But we haven't seen the HKMA name in the market today.' \par \par \uc2  Market participants, however, are showing their jitters over the Hong Kong dollar in the forward exchange market where premiums have been rising steadily since the beginning of this week. \par \par \uc2  However, one local trader said the rise in premiums is a definite sign some players are amassing Hong Kong dollars for another possible attack on the domestic \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  In the forward \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, the six-month premium is quoted at 3,100 points from 2,350 points previously. The three-month premium is quoted at 1,500 points, compared with 1,050 points late during the previous session. \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 07-01-98 \par \par \uc2  0837GMT \par \par \uc2  1053 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du170041k\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
