y see as\par evidence the Asian central banks will act tonight.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires  01-07-98\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 0644EST\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument cm00000020010916du170036o\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
