\par\par \b \uc2  HK Dlr Flat Late; Fears Of HKMA  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Support HK$ \b0\par\par\uc2 249 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 Januar 1998\par 10:28\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 HONG KONG\b0 \highlight\uc2  (Dow Jones)--Despite steep falls in \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  around Asia, the Hong Kong dollar remained unchanged in late trading Tuesday as dealers were reluctant to weaken the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  since it would most likely draw the \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  into the market. \par \par \uc2  Traders are convinced the \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  if the U.S. dollar climbs significantly past HK$7.7500, a conviction lending 'natural' support to the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Around 0910 GMT (4:10 a.m. EST), the U.S. dollar is flat at HK$7.7500, compared with late Monday. \par \par \uc2  'It seems there are some big names offering at the HK$7.7500 level...which is why the spot rate doesn't move much even though the Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  are all weakening,' one chief trader at a European bank said. \par \par \uc2  The big names, usually the largest banks in the territory, are thought to have sell orders at the HK$7.7500 to the U.S. dollar level on behalf of the HKMA, the dealer said. \par \par \uc2  Dealers were more active, however, in the forward exchange market where premiums continued to rise, indicating increased Hong Kong dollar hedging. \par \par \uc2  In the forward \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, the six-month premium is quoted at 2,350 points, up from 2,300 points previously. The three-month premium is quoted at 980 points, compared with 950 points late during the previous session. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 06-01-98 \par \par \uc2  0928GMT \par \par \uc2  1053 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du16002l6\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
