\par\par \b \uc2  HK Dollar Flat Late As  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Fears Curb Weakening \b0\par\par\uc2 276 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 Januar 1998\par 09:55\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 HONG KONG\b0 \highlight\uc2  (Dow Jones)--Concerns \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong\b0 \highlight\uc2  monetary authorities will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market Monday supported the \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar, which was unchanged in late trading compared with the previous session, traders said. \par \par \uc2  'The spot rate is relatively unchanged because everyone knows that (the HK$7.7500 per U.S. dollar level) is a level where the \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  several times in previous months,' a money markets chief at a U.S. bank said. \par \par \uc2  Around 0846 GMT (3:46 a.m. EST), the U.S. dollar is unchanged at HK$7.7495 compared with late Friday. \par \par \uc2  The money markets chief said he didn't detect local monetary authorities in the market Monday, but 'they might have done transactions through commercial banks' which is hard to substantiate. \par \par \uc2  Though traders are reluctant to move the spot rate much, a substantial amount of buying was seen in the forward market, indicating increased hedging activity as Asia's financial crisis worsens. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said Singapore-based foreign banks were seen buying forward exchange rate contracts throughout the day. \par \par \uc2  'The forward market has shifted to the right hand side quite a bit,' meaning there's more buying interest in the market, the U.S. bank money markets chief said. 'We heard the buying positions came from outsiders' mostly in Singapore. \par \par \uc2  In the forward \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, the six-month premium is quoted at 2,300 points from 1,900 points previously. The three-month premium is quoted at 950 points, compared with 680 points late during the previous session. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 05-01-98 \par \par \uc2  0855GMT \par \par \uc2  1053 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du15002wv\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
