\par\par \b \uc2  HK Dlr Early Up As Commercial Demand For U.S. Dlrs Eases \b0\par\par\uc2 299 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 31 Dezember 1997\par 05:11\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  HONG KONG (Dow Jones)--Recent buying of U.S. dollars for year-end book squaring fizzled out on the last day of 1997, allowing the Hong Kong dollar to strengthen slightly early Wednesday, traders said. \par \par \uc2  Moreover, at least one trader said direct or indirect \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  at the HK$7.7500 per U.S. dollar level kicked the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  higher, its rise accelerated by thin market conditions. \par \par \uc2  As is its general policy, the HKMA declined to comment on its daily market activities. \par \par \uc2  Around 0400 GMT, the U.S. dollar is quoted at HK$7.7480, down from HK$7.7490 late Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is expected to trade in a range of HK$7.7475 and HK$7.7490 Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  'A lot of people who've been filling their U.S. dollar requirements over the last few days don't need to anymore' which helped strengthen the Hong Kong dollar, a \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  manager at an Asian bank said. \par \par \uc2  Hedging of Hong Kong dollars eased in the forward exchange rate market, with premiums edging slightly lower. \par \par \uc2  In the forward \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, the six-month premium is quoted at 1,930 points from 2,100 points previously. The three-month premium is quoted at 700 points, compared with 730 points late during the previous session. \par \par \uc2  The overnight Hong Kong Interbank Offered Rate is quoted at 4.5.%-4.625% by Union Bank of Switzerland, up from 4.0%-4.25% late Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  The benchmark three-month rate is 9.375%, down from 9.5%-9.75%% late Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  For more Hibor news, please refer to Dow Jones Markets, page [1085]. \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 31-12-97 \par \par \uc2  0411GMT \par \par \uc2  1053 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dtcv0a0x7\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
