\par\par \b \uc2  HK Dollar Steady Early On Concerns Of HKMA  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 327 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 Dezember 1997\par 06:21\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 HONG KONG\b0 \highlight\uc2  (AP-Dow Jones)--The \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar is nearly flat Tuesday and is likely to stay where it is on concerns that the quasi-\b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will step in to cool the dollar if it rises further. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. dollar was trading at HK$7.7495 early Tuesday and has held there in extremely quiet trading throughout the morning. At that level it's virtually steady from HK$7.7497 late Monday. \par \par \uc2  The head of Treasury at a domestic bank said participants are unwilling to test the Hong Kong \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2 's resolve to keep the U.S. dollar under HK$7.750. \par \par \uc2  He said he believes the HKMA was in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market late Monday, when the U.S. dollar peaked briefly at HK$7.750 and has been there again Tuesday to ensure the dollar doesn't hit that level. \par \par \uc2  The HKMA didn't reply to a phone call, but doesn't typically comment on the activities of its dealing room. \par \par \uc2  With the U.S. dollar stalled at just below HK$7.750 and local interbank rates falling as concerns that South Korea's economic troubles could lead to another bout of \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  speculation in Hong Kong, there's little reason to think the Hong Kong dollar is going to move much over the next several sessions, the treasurer said. \par \par \uc2  'The market has a lack of liquidity, and most traders are silent in the market and don't want to make fresh positions before the year-end and right before the election date of Korea. I think in the next two days, the 'TT' will remain very quiet,' he said. \par \par \uc2  South Korea's election take place on Thursday. \par \par \uc2  For more news on interbank market activity, please see Dow Jones Markets [page 1085]. \par \par \uc2  -By Adam S. Najberg; (852) 2802-7002; naj@asiaonline.net \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 16-12-97 \par \par \uc2  0521GMT \par \par \uc2  1053 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dtcg09ohp\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
