\par\par \b \uc2  HK Dollar Steady; Investors Leery About Stk Mkt, Region \b0\par\par\uc2 351 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 Dezember 1997\par 04:21\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  HONG KONG (AP-Dow Jones)--The Hong Kong dollar is steady Monday at lower levels it last hit, but market participants warn that they're still leery about sudden downturns in the home stock market and renewed regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  volatility. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. dollar has held to a HK$7.7490-97 range so far Monday and is quoted at the high end of that band at 0310 GMT (10:10 p.m. EST Sunday), flat from late Friday. \par \par \uc2  A \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer at a European bank said there's little activity in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, but there's a lot of nervous anticipation. \par \par \uc2  She said she doesn't believe the dollar has a realistic chance of breaking above HK$7.7500, with most participants reluctant to push it there, fearing \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong Monetary Authority intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  There's already talk of the HKMA having been in the three-month money market Monday, trying to signal the interbank interest rate lower. But rates were already falling on their own. For more news on the interbank market, please see Dow Jones Markets [page 1085]. \par \par \uc2  Forward \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  premiums are also falling Monday, after rising along with interbank rates late last week on concerns that South Korea's financial systems turmoil would lead to another bout of Hong Kong dollar speculation. \par \par \uc2  Those premiums could rise if U.S.-based fund management houses continue to hedge Hong Kong dollar exposure, as they did last week. The six-month premium is 2,100 points, from 2,600 points late Friday. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer said a lower rate situation could prove only temporary at the first sign of distress from the falling stock market or renewed concerns about South Korea or \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  volatility in Southeast Asia. \par \par \uc2  She also noted that mainland Chinese banks holding excess Hong Kong dollar liquidity have been lending in the early morning for the past several sessions, pushing interbank rates down in early trading before activity in London and New York drives them back up. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 15-12-97 \par \par \uc2  0321GMT \par \par \uc2  1053 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dtcf09mth\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
