\par\par \b \uc2  HK Late Hibor: Rates Edge Down On Liquidity, Stable HK$ \b0\par\par\uc2 285 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 Dezember 1997\par 11:21\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  HONG KONG (AP-Dow Jones)--The Hong Kong interbank rates edged down late Friday, as a highly liquid overnight market made banks less nervous about lending money for an extended period of time. \par \par \uc2  The overnight Hong Kong Interbank Offered Rates is quoted at 4.116% by Union Bank of Switzerland, a touch lower than 4.125% late Thursday and 4.188% early Friday. \par \par \uc2  The three-month rate is quoted at 10.75%, down from 11% late Thursday but virtually unchanged from early Friday. \par \par \uc2  'There is less panic in the market (than Thursday). Banks seem to be quite well-funded at the moment. They are less nervous about lending longer-term money,' said the head of treasury at a Chinese bank. \par \par \uc2  'As long as the overnight rate doesn't go above 5.0%, I don't see the longer-term rates going any higher,' he added. \par \par \uc2  A money market dealer at an European bank noted that the stabilizing Hong Kong dollar also helped ease interbank rates. 'People see the HKMA (Hong Kong \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) is determined to defend the Hong Kong dollar at (HK$)7.750 (against the U.S. dollar),' and they are less worried about more speculative attacks on the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . A big Hong Kong bank was seen lending a large amount of money in the one-month money market Friday, he added. \par \par \uc2  The U.S dollar hit a six-week high of HK$7.7500 late Friday, but quickly slipped back to HK$7.7497, as traders grew wary that the \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  could \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 12-12-97 \par \par \uc2  1021GMT \par \par \uc2  1085 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dtcc09k2u\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
