\par\par \b \uc2  HK Dollar Unchanged; Key Resistance To Halt Further Rise \b0\par\par\uc2 329 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 17 November 1997\par 04:31\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  HONG KONG (AP-Dow Jones)--The Hong Kong dollar is virtually unchanged early Monday, with any boost garnered from an expected drop in local interbank rates stymied by firm technical resistance. \par \par \uc2  'The overnight rate is expected to fall, which is more favorable for the stock market and the (Hong Kong) dollar,' a chief trader at an Asian bank said. 'People expect rates to stay at these levels or go down...which means the Hong Kong dollar will stay firm.' \par \par \uc2  Around 0315 GMT (10:15 p.m. EST), the U.S. dollar is quoted at HK$7.7303, down slightly from HK$7.7312 late Friday. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. unit is expected to trade in a range of HK$7.7300 and HK$7.7320 Monday. \par \par \uc2  However, traders said strong resistance at HK$7.7300 will prevent the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  from rising any farther. \par \par \uc2  'Nobody wants to trade the 'TT' (the U.S. dollar against the Hong Kong dollar) below HK$7.7300 because it could prompt' the \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market, another chief trader at a foreign bank said. \par \par \uc2  The overnight Hong Kong Interbank Offered Rate is quoted a touch higher at 4.5%-5% by Hongkong & Shanghai Banking Corp. and Deutsche Bank from 4.25%-4.50% late Friday. The benchmark three-month rate is quoted at around 11.0% by Hongkong Bank and 10.5%-11% by Deutsche Bank, compared with 10.0%-11.0% late Friday. \par \par \uc2  For more Hibor news, please refer to Dow Jones Markets, \par \par \uc2  Forward premiums are off slightly Monday reflecting increasing confidence investors have towards holding Hong Kong dollars. \par \par \uc2  In the forward \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, the three-month premium is quoted at 900 points from 1,000 late Friday. The six-month premium is quoted at 1800 points, compared with 2,100 points late during the previous session. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 17-11-97 \par \par \uc2  0331GMT \par \par \uc2  1053 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dtbh08pwy\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
