\par\par \b \uc2  China offers  \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong \highlight\uc2  support, shuns  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2  By William Kazer \par \uc2 535 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 Oktober 1997\par 09:22\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  SHANGHAI, Oct 29 (Reuters) - China's communist leaders have offered soothing pledges of confidence amid \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong\b0 \highlight\uc2 's stock turmoil but have shunned \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , leaving freewheeling markets to sort out problems on their own. \par \par \uc2  Their laissez faire stance in this first crisis since Beijing recovered the former British colony on July 1 has earned them high marks -- in this case at least -- for keeping their promise of a high degree of autonomy, analysts said on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  Their style has also contrasted dramatically with the name-calling and finger-pointing of Malaysian Prime Minister Mahathir Mohamad, who has found a host of foreign forces to blame for a crisis that has dealt a blow to financial markets around the world. \par \par \uc2  "They have made all the right noises," said Richard Margolis, first vice president, research, at Merrill Lynch Asia Pacific, speaking of China's leaders. \par \par \uc2  "They have offered general support and have said they will leave Hong Kong to sort out its own problems," he said from Hong Kong. \par \par \uc2  Hong Kong's stock market had staggered under successive waves of selling, triggered by regional financial worries that have since spread to Wall Street. \par \par \uc2  Hong Kong's blue chip Hang Seng index sank a stunning 13.7 percent on Tuesday after a 5.8 percent drop on Monday, though it came roaring back with an 18 percent gain late on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  While many critics in Hong Kong have viewed with scepticism China's "one country, two system" formula for Hong Kong -- in this case Beijing has been holding to its end of the bargain. \par \par \uc2  "On this test, it's been passed," said Margolis. \par \par \uc2  China's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has made it known it had weapons in its arsenal -- $134.07 billion in foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves -- and was ready to offer support if needed. \par \par \uc2  President Jiang Zemin, speaking in the United States, said he had confidence in Hong Kong, echoing statements of the former colony's own leaders. \par \par \uc2  "China has handled the situation very well; it has left Hong Kong to handle its own problems," said Francis Leung, group managing director, Peregrine Investment Holdings Ltd. \par \par \uc2  "But senior Chinese officials have said openly if Hong Kong wants China's help, they are ready to help at any time." \par \par \uc2  Beijing has not been shy of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in its own unruly markets but it has felt content to keep a watchful eye on developments this time around. \par \par \uc2  China's tightly controlled news media has reported on the financial crisis but has avoided placing the blame on foreign speculators. \par \par \uc2  Qiu Xiaohua, chief economist at the State Statistical Bureau, told reporters the best weapon China had was to ensure its own economy remained on a sound footing, saying that would support Hong Kong. \par \par \uc2  Other Chinese economists agreed this was the right approach. \par \par \uc2  "Hong Kong's problems are temporary," said Yang Qixian of the State Commission for Restructuring the Economy, speaking from Beijing. \par \par \uc2  "I think Hong Kong can resolve its problems itself. And under the 'one country, two systems' formula we can't use mainland methods to deal with Hong Kong problems." \par \par \uc2  -- Shanghai newsroom (86) 21-6279-7004; fax 21-6279-7174 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011003dtat03ge1\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
