es would have adequate liquidity to meet expected demand for the IPO shares. \par \par \uc2  'I think it's very untimely,' Fung said. 'When you have this hedging demand, big banks with big deposit bases don't have the money right away.' \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 21-10-97 \par \par \uc2  1057GMT \par \par \uc2  1135 4204 55128 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dtal07wnn\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
