\par\par \b \uc2  HK Dollar Weak Late -2: Talk Of HKMA  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 272 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 Oktober 1997\par 10:00\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  The one-year forward premium has risen to 2,600 points late Tuesday from 2,100 points Monday. At that level, the premium suggests an exchange rate of HK$7.9580 one year from now. The rising premium indicates nervous investors are moving to hedge their Hong Kong dollar exposure and are willing to pay a premium in U.S. dollar terms to protect themselves. \par \par \uc2  There may also be a speculative element to Tuesday's nervous activity, with speculators tending to go through the money markets for Hong Kong dollars, driving up rates and then using the money as leverage to sell the Hong Kong dollar short in the forward \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. \par \par \uc2  Despite Tuesday's weak market conditions, most dealers said they didn't detect \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong Monetary Authority intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  But a chief treasury official at an Asian bank said 'in this kind of volatile market, I suspect the government has already stepped in' to support the Hong Kong dollar. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par A \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Monetary Authority\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  spokeswoman declined to comment on the market\par talk.\par Hong Kong Dollar Interbank Offered Rates (Hibor)\par                            Tuesday         Monday\par Overnight                  7.25%           4.75%\par 1-Week                     7.875%          6.75%\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par For a full list of the latest quotes on Hibor rates, please refer to\par Dow Jones Markets, page [2705]. For daily fixings in the Hibor market,\par as quoted by the Hong Kong Association of Banks, please refer to Dow\par Jones Markets, pages [9898]-[9899]. For latest Hong Kong dollar bill,\par note and bond quotes, please refer to Dow Jones Markets page\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 21-10-97\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 0800GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1053 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dtal07vcw\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
