\par\par \b \uc2  Exotic  \highlight22\uc2 Currency \highlight\uc2 /HK Dlr-2:Limited  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 313 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 Oktober 1997\par 17:06\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  Noting that 'speculators will never be scared off,' Kwan nonetheless said he expects Southeast Asia's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  unrest to seep into the territory's systems at a slow, non-lethal rate. \par \par \uc2  'Hong Kong has a problem mainly because its neighbors have a problem,' Kwan said. 'My personal view is that it's best for the Hong Kong dollar to depreciate at a slightly slower pace, something on the order of 10%, because our neighbors' \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  have depreciated,' he said. \par \par \uc2  Other participants said they don't understand the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  bears and point to the Hong Kong dollar's performance over the past four months as financial markets melted down and Southeast Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  depreciated sharply against the U.S. dollar. \par \par \uc2  During that period, the U.S. dollar has held to a tight HK$7.7360-HK$7.7515 range, a fluctuation of only 0.2%, with \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  at a minimum. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar hasn't been untouched by speculators. The Hong Kong \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  acknowledged one bout with a \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  speculator in July that cost US$1.0 billion to defend in one day. Market participants suspect other, minor \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  While the World Bank meeting was going on, several participants who declined to be named said they saw the \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  placing a small, but highly visible, Hong Kong dollar buy order, signaling to the market that it didn't want embarassing weakness with the world's top financial officials in town. \par \par \uc2  The buy order on Sept. 23 dropped the U.S. dollar below HK$7.7400 for the first time since May 23 and sent it as low as HK$7.7365 on Sept. 26, when most \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the region were nosediving against the dollar, these market participants said. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 09-10-97 \par \par \uc2  1506GMT \par \par \uc2  1106 1838 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dta907lsf\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
