\par\par \b \uc2  HK Dlr Down Midday On Stk Mkt Jitters; Trading Cautious \b0\par\par\uc2 288 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 September 1997\par 07:16\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  HONG KONG (AP-Dow Jones)--The Hong Kong dollar is mildly weaker Tuesday in response to a continued drop in the home share market. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. dollar is trading at HK$7.7485 at 0511 GMT (1:11 a.m. EDT), up from HK$7.7470 around the same time Monday. The dollar has traded in a HK$7.7478-87 range so far Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  The head of money markets at a North American bank said he has seen some selling of the Hong Kong dollar in response to a continued drop in the Hong Kong share market. \par \par \uc2  The blue-chip Hang Seng Index fell 294.49 points, or 2.2%, in morning trading Tuesday and has slipped by a total of about 15% since late last week. \par \par \uc2  Fund managers are cashing in on profitable investments to meet redemption demands from investors exiting weak Southeast Asian markets. Smaller investors are selling to meet margin calls on short positions. \par \par \uc2  But he said he isn't detecting heavy nervousness or a significant capital outflow from the territory. \par \par \uc2  He said because of cautious \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market trading, the Hong Kong dollar is holding to a tight range. While there is some selling interest in the Hong Kong dollar, the U.S. dollar's upside is limited, he said. \par \par \uc2  As the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  tops HK$7.7490, banks are showing selling interest, concerned that the \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market as the dollar approaches HK$7.7500. \par \par \uc2  Money markets also aren't active, with most participants unwilling to push interbank rates in one direction or another. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 02-09-97 \par \par \uc2  0516GMT \par \par \uc2  1053 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt9206g72\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
