\par\par \b \uc2  HK Dlr Lower Midday; Caution After Indonesia Forward Curbs \b0\par\par\uc2 325 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 1 September 1997\par 05:50\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  HONG KONG (AP-Dow Jones)--The Hong Kong dollar is mildly weaker Monday, with participants showing interest in the U.S. dollar as other regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  continue to weaken. \par \par \uc2  Around 0344 GMT (11:44 p.m. EDT, Sunday), the U.S. dollar is quoted at HK$7.7470, up from HK$7.7462 around the same time Friday. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. unit has traded in a range of HK$7.7465 and HK$7.7485 so far Monday. \par \par \uc2  The dollar briefly hit a high of HK$7.7500 in London Friday, due to regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  volatility concerns, and should be falling back down toward HK$7.7400 Monday, said the head of Treasury at a domestic bank. \par \par \uc2  Despite the expected resistance at HK$7.7500 on concerns of \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the dollar hasn't fallen significantly since active trading began in Hong Kong Monday. \par \par \uc2  'The market doesn't want to buy back the Hong Kong dollar,' the Treasury head said, noting that banks have mainly been buying small amounts of U.S. dollars Friday in commercial dealings. He said he hasn't seen significant or sustained Hong Kong dollar buying interest Monday, following Indonesia's decision to limit forward \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  transactions. \par \par \uc2  The Treasury chief said the administrative move, aimed at curbing \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  speculation, and the rupiah's subsequent fall against the U.S. dollar, are putting participants in Hong Kong on edge. \par \par \uc2  He said he and many other participants aren't clear on whether the move to curb rupiah speculation will work and are being cautious in Hong Kong. They're not willing to take on significant short local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  positions until they see whether central banks or speculators have the upper hand, he said. \par \par \uc2  'If Asian central banks do not use these (measures) successfully, they will have other crises,' he said. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 01-09-97 \par \par \uc2  0350GMT \par \par \uc2  1053 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt9106hp1\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
