\par\par \b \uc2  HK Dollar Lower Midday; No  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2 , Speculation Seen \b0\par\par\uc2 306 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 August 1997\par 05:17\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 HONG KONG\b0 \highlight\uc2  (AP-Dow Jones)--The \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar is weaker Wednesday after being taken higher during the previous session by suspected \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong Monetary Authority intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Forward and money market conditions look as if they're returning to normal following speculation Friday and volatile activity early Tuesday, when markets reopened after a three-day layoff, a domestic bank's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer said. \par \par \uc2  The decision by the Federal Open Market Committee to leave short-term U.S. interest rates untouched has had little impact on Wednesday trading, the dealer said. \par \par \uc2  Two participants said they believe the quasi-\b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  made a pre-emptive strike against London speculators late Tuesday, directly selling U.S. dollars from its dealing room from HK$7.7435. The \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  declined to comment on the market suspicions. \par \par \uc2  The dollar moved quickly downward to HK$7.7385 and held around HK$7.7400 in London and New York. \par \par \uc2  With the \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  not seen in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market Wednesday, the Hong Kong dollar has been trading at weaker levels between HK$7.7419 and HK$7.7429. The U.S. dollar is at HK$7.7419 at 0310 GMT (11:10 p.m. EDT Tuesday). The dealer said participants, himself included, believed the U.S. dollar was undervalued at HK$7.7400 and have taken it to where they feel it should be. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer said he believes the \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  returned some liquidity to short-term money markets early Wednesday, allowing the overnight interbank rate to fall to 8.0% from about 9.00% late Tuesday and a high of 22% early in the previous session. The overnight rate is down to 6.5% at 0310 GMT (11:10 p.m. EDT). \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 20-08-97 \par \par \uc2  0317GMT \par \par \uc2  1053 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt8k0646c\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
