\par\par \b \uc2  HK$ Bonds/Interbank Rates -2: Bills Auction Went Poorly \b0\par\par\uc2 252 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 19 August 1997\par 12:02\par \uc2  Capital Markets Report \par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    Amid speculative activity surrounding the Hong Kong\par dollar, money market rates were held around 9.00% and, by\par some accounts, even soared briefly to 22% - a move many saw\par as the Hong Kong \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Monetary Authority\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's way to ward off an\par attack on the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par    Around 0947 GMT (5:47 a.m. EDT), the one-week Hong Kong\par Interbank Offered Rate was at 8.75%, up from 7.375% Friday.\par Markets were closed Monday for a holiday.\par    The U.S. dollar was at HK$7.7395, down from HK$7.7495\par late Friday. \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  traders said the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Hong Kong\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  dollar\par strengthened late in the day on \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  by the quasi\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 . The HKMA didn't return phone calls for\par comment.\par    The HKMA's auction of one- and three-month bills went\par poorly. The average yield of HK$5.0 billion of 1-month bills\par jumped to its highest level at 9.23%, almost 300 basis\par points higher than last week's auction at 6.35%.\par    The average yield on the HK$2.0 billion three-month bill\par auction also hit a record high at 7.90%.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  The yield on last\par week's auction was more than 100 basis points lower at\par 6.47%.\par    For more information on Hong Kong \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Monetary Authority\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par money market activity, bill and note prices and other\par related information, please refer to Dow Jones Markets page\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) DOW JONES NEWS  08-19-97\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 0602EDT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  38700 4118 4178 4340 5096 \par \par \uc2 Dokument cm00000020011006dt8j01reb\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
