\par\par \b \uc2  HK$ Bonds Plunge Amid HK Dlr Speculation; 1-Year Yld 7.09% \b0\par\par\uc2 250 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 August 1997\par 11:53\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  HONG KONG (AP-Dow Jones)--A volatile \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market and signs of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  touched off a day-long bout of panic selling in government bonds, traders said late Friday. \par \par \uc2  The sell-off drove yields on bonds with maturities over six months substantially past 7.00%. At one point, the yield on the one-year Exchange Fund bill touched 7.50%, a level not seen this year, a trader at a Hong Kong bank said. \par \par \uc2  'Bonds, bills, the whole market is going down,' a trader at a European bank said. 'The tt swap rates are rising...and no one wants to be holding bonds before the long weekend.' Markets are closed Monday for the annual Ghost Festival. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said most of the activity occured in the shorter-dated instruments, with the most selling seen in one-year bills. \par \par \uc2  Late Friday, the one-year Exchange Fund bill yield rose to 7.09%, up 51 basis points from 6.58% late Thursday. The 10-year EF note yield advanced to 7.21%, up from 7.11% Thursday. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  traders smelled \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  Friday by the \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  as forward market premiums soared and money market rates kicked past 7.00%. \par \par \uc2  All this worked to weaken the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and drive bond dealers, fearful of holding Hong Kong-dollar assets, out of the market. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 15-08-97 \par \par \uc2  0953GMT \par \par \uc2  4178 5096 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt8f062qa\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
