\par\par \b \uc2  HK Dollar Lower Late Amid Speculation In Forward Market \b0\par\par\uc2 366 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 August 1997\par 10:33\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  HONG KONG (AP-Dow Jones)--Speculation in the forward market has pushed forward premiums sharply higher Friday, which in turn has led the spot Hong Kong dollar lower, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers said. \par \par \uc2  'Maybe (the speculators) think it's hard to move the spot Hong Kong dollar above HK$7.7500, so they are looking at the forward,' said a \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer at a Chinese bank. There is widespread belief that the \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to keep the rate below, or close to that figure, according to \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers. \par \par \uc2  So, while spot rates remain relatively stable, because of suspected \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the speculators may profit from their forward positions, when forward premiums keep soaring, dealers said. However, increased demand for forward positions have also driven the Hong Kong Interbank Offered Rates sharply higher, making the speculators' short Hong Kong dollar positions expensive, they added. \par \par \uc2  Some market participants suspect that the HKMA is helping drive up interbank rates as a way to ward off the speculators. HKMA officials, who are usually silent on their market activity, if any, didn't immediately return telephone calls seeking comment. \par \par \uc2  Around 0810 GMT (4:10 a.m. EDT), the spot U.S. dollar is quoted at HK$7.7495, unchanged from the midday quote but higher than HK$7.7460 around the same time Thursday. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. unit has traded in a range of HK$7.7480 and HK$7.7500 so far Friday. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Foward premiums, meanwhile, have risen to 1,100 points from 650 points\par Thursday for six months, and to 1,800 points from 1,000 points for one\par year.\par Hong Kong Dollar Interbank Offered Rates (Hibor)\par                            Friday          Thursday\par Overnight                  6.25%           6.25%\par 1-Week                     8.50%           6.375%\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par For a full list of the latest quotes on Hibor rates, please refer to\par Dow Jones Markets page [2705]. For daily fixings in the Hibor market, as\par quoted by the Hong Kong Association of Banks, please refer to Dow Jones\par Markets pages [9898]-[9899].\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par For latest bill, note and bond quotes, please refer to Dow Jones\par Markets page [9888].\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 15-08-97\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 0833GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1053 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt8f062ce\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
