n the one-year forward rate up to 1400.0 points from 900.0 points Monday. It began the week at 690.0 points. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. dollar, meanwhile, is only a touch higher than Thursday's HK$7.7480 in Asia at HK$7.7495 as of 0320 GMT (11:20 p.m. Thursday, EDT). \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 15-08-97 \par \par \uc2  0321GMT \par \par \uc2  1053 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt8f06185\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
