\par\par \b \uc2  HKMA  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2 /Peg System -2: Thin Activity In London \b0\par\par\uc2 253 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 August 1997\par 08:24\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong\b0 \highlight\uc2 's real-time settlement system virtually ensures that the HKMA would have noticed the activity during the thin London hours, and would have drawn a quick response from the HKMA, says Andrew Fung, head of treasury at Commonwealth Bank of Australia in Hong Kong. \par \par \uc2  Fung, like most other bankers contacted, says he wasn't privy to the specifics of the July \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  By buying \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollars, the HKMA was able to push the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  higher, making funding costs of the forward positions intolerably expensive for the speculator, says a \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer at a European bank. \par \par \uc2  Participants say the HKMA went through HSBC Holdings PLC (H.HKS) to buy its Hong Kong dollars. The head of HSBC Markets' Hong Kong dollar desk, Mike Powell, says he knew all the details of the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  but declined to provide them. \par \par \uc2  Powell says he was surprised that the HKMA provided any details, and referred all questions to the quasi-\b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  'I'm in an impossible position,' Powell says. 'I was surprised there was even those comments made.' \par \par \uc2  The HKMA's move to squeeze out the speculator came during some of the most jittery days for Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , following Thailand's move July 2 to float the baht. A few days after the contagion affected Hong Kong, on July 21, Indonesia and the Philippines permitted some Depreciation of their \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  due to market pressure. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 13-08-97 \par \par \uc2  0624GMT \par \par \uc2  1137 62554 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt8d05zk4\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
