\par\par \b \uc2  HKMA  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  May Be A Sign Of Worry About Peg System \b0\par\par\uc2  By Adam S. Najberg \par \uc2 274 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 August 1997\par 08:20\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 HONG KONG\b0 \highlight\uc2  (AP-Dow Jones)--Hong Kong authorities' admission that they had a brief bout with a \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  speculator last month signaled to the market one of the strongest levels of concern about the territory's pegged \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  system yet, market participants say. \par \par \uc2  It took US$1.0 billion but only about two hours for the Hong Kong \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the quasi-\b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , to force an unidentified speculator into loss-making positions on that July day, Financial Secretary Sir Donald Tsang Yam-kuen told local media Tuesday. The financial secretary made the revelation during a briefing about Hong Kong's plan to help the Thai \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  with a US$1.0 billion contribution to a bailout fund. \par \par \uc2  The HKMA, which reports to the financial secretary, said the action involved direct buying of Hong Kong dollars, but the financial secretary didn't get more specific about the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Various market sources said Wednesday that it took place on July 18. A speculator - believed to be a hedge fund - began building up short Hong Kong dollar forward positions through banks in the London center that Friday afternoon, they said. \par \par \uc2  'I heard from traders it was a hedge fund,' said MMS International financial analyst Meryl Phang. 'In a way, it does make sense because they (hedge funds) are going into some of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  before they start to move. Some of these traders suspect the hedge fund was playing on the `domino effect'' that was affecting other Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 13-08-97 \par \par \uc2  0620GMT \par \par \uc2  1137 62554 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt8d05zjd\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
