\par\par \b \uc2  HKMA Confirms/HK$  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  -2: Normally Doesn't Comment \b0\par\par\uc2 154 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 August 1997\par 13:17\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 HONG KONG\b0 \highlight\uc2  (AP-Dow Jones)--The \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Tuesday confirmed that it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on a single day in July to defend the \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar against the activity of a single speculator. \par \par \uc2  But a spokesman for the quasi \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  - which normally won't talk about its market activity - declined to talk about how the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was engineered or about amounts spent. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong\b0 \highlight\uc2  media earlier in the day quoted the Financial Secretary Donald Tsang, who oversees the authority, as saying US$1.0 billion was spent to defend the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which is pegged to the U.S. dollar. \par \par \uc2  'That day in July, within two hours, the \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  and the speculator lost money,' said Albert Chan, a spokesman for the HKMA. He said the activity took place on a Friday afternoon. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 12-08-97 \par \par \uc2  1117GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt8c05wry\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
